From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcrt: Implement the Concurrency runtime helper functions and _SpinLock.

Concurrency runtime helpers that were spec stubs in msvcr100 .. msvcr120
and concrt140 (msvcr120_app forwards): GetProcessorCount,
GetProcessorNodeCount, GetOSVersion (IResourceManager::OSVersion from the
reported Windows version), GetSchedulerId and GetExecutionContextId (new
ids from the counters the schedulers and contexts use), details::Log2,
details::GetSharedTimerQueue, details::_UnderlyingYield, the deprecated
EnableTracing/DisableTracing (S_OK), the _SpinWait copy and move
assignments and details::_SpinLock (a guard that spins with _SpinWait until
it takes the flag, and clears it when destroyed).
